<ul><li>Booking is a real data model. Their API exposes calendar objects with PRIMARY, CREW and USER types, IANA timezone, <code>minBookAheadHours</code>, <code>maxBookAheadDays</code>, <code>bufferMinutes</code> and an <code>isDoubleBookingAllowed</code> flag. Appointments carry status BOOKED, CANCELLED, COMPLETED or NO_SHOW and a source enum that includes VOICE_AGENT.</li><li>Confirmations are records too. The payload includes <code>appointmentNotifications</code> with medium, templateId, sentAt, recipient role and a status of QUEUED, SENT or FAILED.</li><li>Exact slot AI booking into six field service platforms named in their llms.txt: Jobber, Housecall Pro, ServiceTitan, Workiz, Leap and BuilderPrime, with crew and employee assignment.</li><li>Trade logic is genuine. The plumbing page triages active flooding with shut off guidance against slow drains on standard scheduling, and qualifies water heaters on tank versus tankless, capacity, fuel, age and symptoms. The roofing page captures insurance company, claim number and adjuster visit status.</li><li>SMS is productized. Two way SMS is the core channel, toll free on Essential and registered 10DLC on Growth and Scale, up to three timed follow ups per channel that auto stop when the lead replies, human takeover per conversation, and SMS follow up generated from a voice call transcript.</li><li>They reply inside the marketplaces. Thumbtack is OAuth plus webhooks with native two way replies. Google LSA has an email responder through the awexpress.google.com relay plus a direct Google Ads API sync. Yelp replies land in the Yelp thread.</li><li>The API is careful work. OpenAPI 3.0.3, 35 paths, 40 operations, HMAC SHA-256 webhook signing over timestamp plus raw body with a five minute staleness check, cursor pagination, published rate limits, and five JavaScript widget clients sharing one lifecycle.</li><li>The failure path is designed. Their AI voice setup guide tells you to set a backup number in case the AI is unavailable and warns not to reuse the forwarding number so you do not create a loop. Over limit behavior is honest: leads keep logging, replies stop.</li><li>Attribution is unusually complete: gclid, fbclid, msclkid, ttclid, snapcid, gbraid, wbraid, gad_source, gclsrc, igshid and srsltid plus UTMs, GA client and session id, page URL and referrer, closed with invoice based revenue attribution read back out of the CRM.</li><li>Twenty seven competitor comparison pages, including the human answering services they are displacing.</li></ul>
